window.products.push({"id":1184085,"name":"Phanteks (P-GO240MPH_DWT01) Glacier One 240MPH D-RGB AIO Liquid CPU Cooler, Infinity Mirror Pump Cap Design, 2X Silent 120mm MP PWM Fans, 2X D-RGB Hal","category":"electronics","retail price":183.08,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51p82zapyqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Phanteks Glacier One 240MPH is an all-in-one liquid CPU cooler capable of cooling powerful CPUs while operating silently. The dual 120mm MP PWM fans offer high airflow, low noise, and excellent cooling performance with its pressure optimized fan blades. Installation is a breeze thanks to the pre-filled all in one solution, flexible braided tubing and Tube Clips that helps routing the tubing and fan cables. The Glacier One 240MPH features an infinity mirror pump cap design with a tempered glass window with integrated D-RGB lighting and 2x D-RGB Halos Fan Frames. Simply connect to a D-RGB equipped Phanteks chassis or motherboard to control, sync and expand your lighting setup. Keep your system cool with the Phanteks Glacier One 240MPH. Socket Compatibility: Intel Socket LGA 115x, 1366, 2011, 2011-3, 2066, 1200. AMD Socket AM4, sTRX4*, TR4*(*Threadripper bracket included with CPU). Pump Block: 93 x 92 x 41mm (LxWxH), 3.66 x 3.62 x 1.62 inch. Radiator: 273 x 120 x 27mm (LxWxH), 10.75 x 4.73 x 1.06 inch. Fin Damage QC: Max 10 fin total/Max 4 consecutive fins allowed. Tubing Length: 400mm. Tubing outside diameter: 11mm OD. Pump PWM Cable: 245mm. D-RGB 3-PIN Cable: 550mm + 75mm, Daisy-Chain Connector. Cold Plate: Copper. Radiator: Aluminum. Tubing: EPDM rubber with white braided sleeves. Housing: ABS plastic. Cooling Liquid: Distilled Water and Propylene Glycol mix. Infinity Mirror Window: Tempered Glass. D-RGB Lighting: Type: 3-PIN Digital-RGB LED strip (5V, data, Ground). Quantity: 14 LED Chips. Power: 5V, 0.42A, 2.1W. Pump: Pump Speed: PWM controlled; pump speed 2800RPM +/- 300 with 100% duty cycle; Out-of-bound temperature sensing enables the pump speed to automatically boost up to 3600rpm when liquid temperature is above 60 degree C. Power: 12V, 0.3A, 3.6W. Bearing: Ceramic bearing and shaft. Noise: 27 dBA. MTTF: 50,000 hours in typical use. Fittings: Rotary type. Thermal Paste: 4.5 W/m-k Pre-applied + Phanteks PH-NDC. 120mm MP PWM Fan: Fan type: PH-F120MP_BK02. Quantity: 2. Dimension: 120 x 120 x 25mm. Speed: 500 - 2200 ± 10% RPM. Air Flow: 13.8 – 60.51 CFM. Fan Static Pressure: 0.17 – 3.41 mm- H₂O. Noise: 18 - 34.2 dBA. Connector: 4-pin PWM. Cable length: 130mm Daisy-Chain. 120mm Halos Fan Frame: Quantity: 2. Dimensions: 120 x 120 x 7mm. Color: White. D-RGB: 30x LED Chips. Connector: 3-PIN Digital-RGB LED strip (5V, data, Ground). Cable length: 550mm + 75mm Daisy-Chain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51p82zapyqL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Phanteks","source_asin":"B098KZKHWR","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1184085","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098KZKHWR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B098KZKHWR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
