window.products.push({"id":1184248,"name":"4K Dash Cam Built-in WiFi 3'' LCD Display 170° Wide Angle Car Camera,Super Night Vision Dash Camera for Cars,Support 512GB Max,Loop-Recording,G-Sensor","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610upNLck0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: 4K WiFi Car Camera 4K UHD resolution elevates video quality, captures car license, road information much easier and will be very useful for your driving safety and traveling records. WDR Technology With the ability to compensate the light and dark points of the frame in a shot, prevents images from being too dark or overexposed, fully balanced exposure, giving a clear image. The dash cam provides sharp images and high quality image even in backlight or low light situations. Unique Distortion Correction Ultra wide angle lens, some distortion occurs at the edges of the image when shooting. Therefore, the dashcam uses a unique distortion correction method to change the distortion effect, in order to see every angle clear and real, bring you a better visual experience for you. Super Night Vision With the high-performance Sony IMX335 STARVIS sensor and the combination of F1.8 wide aperture and 6-glass lens, the dash cam improves low light sensitivity. Combined with WDR technology, the dash cam enhances night vision in low light, show sharp images at night. Built-in-WIFI By connecting to your mobile devices via Wi-Fi, you can view all recording on your phone without unmounting the dash cam or take out the SD card. It is easy to control the cam, view, download. 24h Parking Monitor: With a small built-in battery to wake-up and record footages, the car camera can automatically monitor the surrounding environment. It is the best choice for you to monitors your car for a long time after parking. G-sensor (Emergency Recording) With G-sensor enabled, when it detects the vehicle shake/collision, the dash cam will automatically lock the current footage to prevent video from being overwritten, providing peace of mind in any accident or incident. Packing list: 1 * 4K WiFi Dash camera 1 * Car charger 1 * User manual 360° rotating adjustable dashboard camera: Recording the front, rear and interior video of car at you will. 170° wide-angle: Cover 4 channels without blind spots, eliminating your visual blind spots. 6 layer full HD glass lens: Enhances night vision in a dark environment. License plates and other small wordings can be displayed clearly. Sony IMX335 STARVIS sensor: Captures important details clearly under low light conditions. Tips: -Please check the car camera with its accessories before installation. If any question, please get a fast contact with us. -Please use the car charger cable to power on and test the dash cam is working properly before installing it. -When installing the suction mount, force the suction mount to the glass, exhaust the air in the suction cup frist, and twist the lock to aviod falling off easily. -Format the micro SD card at first use, and clean the memory card regularly to avoid locking videos occupied much capacity. -Memory card is NOT included in the packaging. Max Support 512 GB SD Card.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610upNLck0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B6NNHNZT","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1184248","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6NNHNZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6NNHNZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
