window.products.push({"id":1184266,"name":"CHEERLINK 44 (4 Inputs to 4 Outputs) 4 in 4 Out HDMI True Matrix with IR Remote Control, Power Supply - Supports 3D, Full HD 1080P, auto-Switching,","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GJxWZkF2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The CHEERLINK HTM0404ANR 4x4 Matrix is perfect for gaming and advanced home theater setups. It supports 3D and resolutions of up to 1080p. It provides 4 HDMI inputs, which allows you to connect the Xbox 360, cable box, blu-ray player etc. Any of these four inputs can be independently selected for any of the four outputs. Each display can select the same or different inputs.It has the ability of equalization and amplification to ensure HDMI signal's transmission through long cables run without degrading signal quality. It is the ultimate combination of 1x4 Splitter and 4X1 Switch. The cool metal enclosure protects the insides and keeps the unit cool by aiding in quick heat dissipation. Smart function Automatically sense the input source ports and bypasses the port without signal, press Memory button on the remote controller to remember the active input source port, then the switch will automatically select this input source port when you restart. Specifications *HDMI 1.3 protocol compliant, HDCP 1.2 compliant.*Support 3D, deep color 36bit, CEC.*Transfer date bit rate up to 6.75 Gbps per channel.*Support resolution 1080p/1080i/720p/576p/576i/480p/480i.*Support DTS-HD/true-HD/LPCM7.1/AC3/DTS/DSD audio format.*Can be controlled by a computer, via an RS232 serial port, as well as front panel controls. Package Contents *CHEERLINK HTM0404ANR 4x4 HDMI True Matrix*IR remote control with battery*5V DC Power Supply, AC 110V-240V*User Manual *Software CD Warranty All CHEERLINK HDMI products are backed by a 1 year warranty. Warning All CHEERLINK products are under my registered trademark CHEERLINK. Any violation to my listings or products will be directly reported to amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GJxWZkF2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHEERLINK","source_asin":"B00VM5S9LY","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1184266","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VM5S9LY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VM5S9LY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
