window.products.push({"id":1184297,"name":"Compatible with Hikvision Metal Housing 5MP UltraHD Full Color IP Outdoor Camera with H265+POE Camera, 100Ft Night Vision,Up to 256GB SD Card.Insert 2","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813jm9MrLaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【5M Ultra HD and Night Color】: HITOSINO PoE IP camera uses a CMOS 1/2.8” image sensor and 5MP resolution (2592x1944), Providing clearer picture quality and a wider range. With advanced starlight sensor technology, F1.0 super aperture, and external fill lights with adjustable brightness, even at night with 0.001lux illumination, still get true full-color images and see objects in sharper detail. 【Smart Motion Detection】: Adjustable motion detection zones and sensitivity, HITOSINO security camera is equipped with AI technology to identify moving objects, this surveillance camera will trigger alerts by sending real-time push notifications or alert emails to your device. With its adjustable motion detection zones and sensitivity, you can keep a sharper eye on the true threats and release your mind from unnecessary alerts. 【IP67 Waterproof and Built-in Mic】: The enclosure of the HITOSINO POE IP camera is made of metal, IP67 is weatherproof, can be used in inclement weather. HITOSINO camera built-in Microphone with environment noise filtering records clear voice, providing vivid videos with sound without just silent live stream or playback. 【Easy POE Install and Remote Access】: HITOSINO IP cameras adopt power over Ethernet (PoE) technology, transmit videos and get power, signal, and data via only one network cable, quick installation. With a simple and free HITOSINO App, check what’s happening in your home, office, or store anytime and anywhere. Can also be easily accessed through computers, tablets, and browsers. 【Local and Remote Storage】: The surveillance camera supports 24/7 continuous recording when movement is detected or during a scheduled time. The recorded videos can be saved on the micro SD card (up to 256GB, not included), HITOSINO NVR, NAS, or FTP. Choose a way you prefer and enjoy customized security. For any issues with the product, please contact us to enjoy lifetime tech support and product maintenance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813jm9MrLaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HITOSINO","source_asin":"B0B5XHGTK1","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1184297","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5XHGTK1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5XHGTK1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
