window.products.push({"id":1184342,"name":"Toptrend 4K HDMI Cable 12ft,High Speed CL3 Rated HDMI Cord Supports to 4K 60Hz 1440p 144Hz 1080p 240Hz HDR ARC HDCP 2.2/2.3 for Roku TV Apple TV HDTV ","category":"electronics","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OSYGGrOqL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"[4K display supported] Toptrend 4K Platinum Series HDMI cables were 100% tested to be supported to the resolution up to 4K HDR (3840 x 2160 px), backward supports to the old version on 1440p and 1080p for sure. [High speed & High refresh rate] Besides to support the standard 18Gbps, we tested this series HDMI cables and got the data that the cables especially the short cables like 3ft, 6ft and 12ft cables could provide much wider bandwidth like 27Gbps so that they could carry much more data, much higher refresh rate like 1080p@240Hz, 1440p@144Hz, and more bits on deep colors like 48Bit colors, perfect cables for movies entertaining and gaming players. [Super Good materials] The lengths of 3ft/6ft/12ft/25ft cables of this series were made from Silver Plated Copper on the heavy conductors, if you compare our cables with others, you will find out that our connectors were plated with much heavier gold, and if you use a magnet to have a test, you might find out that others with Iron connectors but ours were in Copper, these are the factors affecting the signal transmission and anti-corrosion performance. [UL CL3 Rated & directional connection] The whole Platinum Series HDMI cables were UL CL3 rated, the cables can be installed behind the wall or over the ceiling. The 35ft, 50ft and 60ft cables were active HDMI cables, boosters were built in plugs to ensure the 4K content could be display with no problem, kindly please note these active cables are directional on connection, please connect the cables as the indication marked on the plugs. [Universal Compatibility] Fully supports to the HDMI 2.0b standard features like 4K Ultr-HD, HDR10, 18Gbps, 2160p,1440p,1080p,ARC,3D surround sound,Dolby TrueHD 7.1,DTS-HD,etc., this 4K high speed HDMI cord series compatible with all of the 4K HDMI devices like HDTV, Roku streaming TV, Roku Ultra, Apple TV, DVD/Blue-ray player, 4K graphics cards on computers, Laptops, Monitors, Projectors, game consoles like PS4, Xbox, Switch, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OSYGGrOqL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toptrend","source_asin":"B0B7RLN1KB","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1184342","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7RLN1KB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7RLN1KB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
