window.products.push({"id":1184467,"name":"MillSO USB to 3.5mm Audio Jack Adapter, Sapphire Blue TRRS USB to AUX Audio Jack External Stereo Sound Card for Headphone, Speaker, PS4, PS5, PC, Lapt","category":"electronics","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HxtlPyYFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MillSO USB to 3.5mm jack audio adapter ideal to connect a TRRS 4-pole CTIA 3.5mm headset, TRRS mic or speaker to PC via USB interface. One combo interface support stereo sound listening + speaking, dual functions. Easily add a 3.5mm TRRS aux port for your devices, or use it as a replacement for a failed 3.5mm to USB audio adapter. (Unidirectional audio transmission: this USB port is output, not input. Audio can only transfer from USB port to 3.5mm port). Compatibility: This USB to aux adapter fits various platforms and systems, Windows 10/8.1/8/7/Vista/XP, OS X, Linux, Google Chromebook, Windows Surface 3 pro, Raspberry Pi, etc. Convert USB port of PC, Laptop, Desktop, PS4... to a TRRS 4-pin audio jack, for connecting 3.5mm headset or speakers. (NOT compatible for IOS standard headphones, TV, amplifier, car, PS3). Driver Free, Plug & Play: Easy to set up, no driver required, just plug and play! USB bus-powered, no external power required. Compact body size and 1-feet-more-length design make sure you will not interfere with other devices when using other USB ports. Perfect for carrying this 3.5mm to USB adapter in a pocket to the office, conference room or at home. Premium Materials: Built-in smart Chipset for high-speed audio signal decoding and offer a full and delicate tone, highly restored quality sound. Robust Sapphire Blue Metal Housing ensures a wear-resistant, anti-corrosion, solid protection, and charming out looking. This USB to audio jack adapter tightly combined 20 Strands of three Cores, enameled copper, soft and durable PVC covers. Its high-density shielding protection ensures high stability sound transmission and a soft touch. Reliable Warranty: MillSO offers an unconditional Warranty for our audio jack to USB external sound card to guard against any quality trouble. Just contact us for MillSO 24-hour customer support team. Our warm support team will solve any problem for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HxtlPyYFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MillSO","source_asin":"B09T6W2K9R","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1184467","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T6W2K9R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T6W2K9R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1184468,"name":"Sony SRS-D4100 4.1 Multimedia and Gaming Speaker System","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VTCF6C2JL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The SRS-D4100 Gaming Speaker System delivers high quality audio with an 80 watt sub-woofer and 12 watt satellite speakers. Play games in stereo or 4.1 surround sound. Listen to music in 2.1 (2 speakers and a Sub) or in dual stereo by utilizing the 2 rear From the Manufacturer Tight on space? You can still enjoy enveloping gaming and PC sound. Take your listening to the next level with Sony's powerful, attractive SRS-D4100 4.1-channel (5-speaker) listening system. The SRS-D4100 consists of four satellites speakers (front and rear left/right speakers), a powered, bass-reflex subwoofer, a wired remote control module for easy listening adjustments, and everything you need to hook it all up. Pumping a total of 128 watts (12 watts per channel for the satellites and a hefty 80 watts for the subwoofer) and offering a choice of processed 4.1-channel or direct stereo sound from its stereo minijack (.125-inch) inputs, the system will render games or music in rich, detailed, hard-hitting sound. Each of the satellites features a single 2.2-inch driver, and their wall-mountable design lets you place them on ceilings or walls, depending on your listening space, and of course you can set them on a desk or shelf using their detachable rotating bases. The sub uses a potent 6.3-inch cone woofer. Dual inputs let you hook up your PC and one other audio source, whether an MP3 player, minidisc player/recorder, CD player, voice recorder, or other device. What's in the Box Four satellite speakers with detachable rotating bases, a subwoofer, a wired remote control module, all requisite cabling, a user's manual, an AC power cord, and warranty information.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VTCF6C2JL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sony","source_asin":"B0001RM9D8","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1184468","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001RM9D8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001RM9D8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
