window.products.push({"id":1184637,"name":"The Joy Factory SmartSuit3 (Joyful Wish Soft Pink) Snap On Stand/Case with Wake Up/Sleep Cover for iPad 4th/3rd/2nd Gen (CSA105)","category":"electronics","retail price":12.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WhGSYQCWL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Joyful Wish case from The Joy Factory boasts a hand-stitched design and fashion colors to complement your iPad. The Joyful Wish's cover provides wake/sleep functionality, holds the case open for comfortable long-term use, and converts into a stand for portrait or landscape viewing. Leather-feel material feels great in your hand while protecting your iPad from scratches and scrapes. Packaging includes inspirational mouse pad and waterproof sleeve. Available in Soft Pink, Soft Gray, and Black. Compatible with New iPad (3rd Generation) and iPad 2. Amazon.com The Joy Factory is pleased to present Joyful Wish, a chic new case for the new iPad (3rd Gen) and iPad 2. This charming new addition will protect your iPad from scratches and smudges while looking beautiful and feeling great in your hand. The hand-stitched design adds an upscale touch to the whimsical Joyful Wish. View larger Magnetic cover and precise cutouts make the Joyful Wish the ideal iPad cover. View larger The Smartest Cover Available The stunning outer design of the Joyful Wish hides impressive features underneath. The Joyful Wish is equipped with magnets that wake your iPad up when you open the cover and put it to sleep when you close it. While your Joyful Wish is open, yet another magnet holds the case open, so your fingers don't have to do quite so much work. Fancy Meets Fanciful The Joyful Wish's fashion design was created to evoke the childhood memory of wishing on a falling star. The hand-stitched design on each case adds an upscale touch to the Joyful Wish's whimsical composition. The leather-feel material on the case's exterior feels cool to the touch, while its soft interior protects your iPad's screen from scratches. Multi-Angle Stand Enjoy your iPad's beautiful screen while watching movies or making FaceTime calls utilizing the Joyful Wish as a stand. The Joyful Wish cover folds into a stand that steadies your iPad at a tall incline ideal for watching video or a low angle perfect for typing. Green meets Gorgeous We want to add more joy to your environment, not more trash. The Joyful Wish comes packaged in a reusable, water-resistant sleeve instead of single-use packaging. This powerful protective cover is strong enough to keep your iPad safe from spills, yet thin enough to transmit your every multi-touch gesture. And taking the place of disposable packing foam, The Joy Factory has included a mouse pad with an inspirational quote for your continued use at home or the office. The Joy Factory is committed to making the best products in the world while being kind to the planet, so each Joy Factory purchase is one you can be proud of. What's in the Box? Joy Factory Joyful Wish Case/Stand for iPad, reusable water-resistant sleeve, mouse pad with inspirational quote.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WhGSYQCWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Joy Factory","source_asin":"B00LZRH05U","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1184637","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LZRH05U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LZRH05U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1184638,"name":"Vowor 4G Smartwatch for Kids with Sim Card, Waterproof Phone Watch with WiFi LBS GPS Tracker Video Chat SOS Camera Alarm Clock Anti Lost Watches Child","category":"electronics","retail price":86.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HU2AZu2SS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Vowor Smart watches 4G for Kids Kids smartwatch supports 4G/3G/2G Nano sim card with data and voice plans. GSM Bands: US: B2/B5 3G Bands (WCDMA): US: B2/B5 4G Band(FDD TDD): US:B2/4/5/7/12/17 Note: 1. you need to have voice and data plan to make the kids phone watch works properly 2. The Vowor 4G kids phone watch is NOT compatible with Verizon or Sprint, we recommend T-Mobile, Speedtalk and AT&T. But it is ok if your own's phone (parent's) card is Verizon or Sprint. The Vowor kids smartwatch doesn't support other APP except Leefine. Q&A: 1. Why the watch doesn’t have the network(The watch shows \"Search ... \" for a long time) (1) The SIM card is not overdue. (2) Check the upper left corner of the watch interface for stable signal icons or up and down arrows. If no, please restart the watch. (3) There may be no set the correct APN. 2. Why the watch cannot recognize the SIM card (1) Confirm that the SIM card is not overdue. (2) Confirm that the SIM card is installed in the right direction. (3) Power off before card insertion. (4) Change the region and try again. 3. Why can't I make a video call (1) Confirm that the SIM card has data and the network signal is stable. (2) Check whether the APP side is disabled for video calls. (3) Other family members who want video calls need to have a Leefine account and bind the watch. (4) Whether all permissions of APP needed are granted. (5) The APP needs to be opened, run and work in the background. Only the video call is initiated on the watch end, the APP end can receive the push message. (6) The video call has just ended. It will take 5 minutes for the watch end to call again. Package Included: 1 x Kids smartwatch 1 x USB cable 1x User manual 1x Watch screen protector 1x sim card","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HU2AZu2SS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vowor","source_asin":"B083PZ5HLB","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1184638","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083PZ5HLB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B083PZ5HLB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
