window.products.push({"id":1184651,"name":"3 Legged Thing Punks Billy 2.0 Carbon Fibre Travel-Friendly Tripod - Compact & Adjustable Camera Tripod with Three Detachable Legs - Darkness (BILLYDA","category":"electronics","retail price":279.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Nb1C8TGdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Meet Billy 2.0 - the new evolution of Punks tripods brought to you by 3 Legged Thing. This lightweight camera tripod is compact and adjustable, made with 100% pure carbon fibre and equipped with three detachable legs for swift and easy conversion, taking your photography to new heights. Extending from 11.8cm up to 1.66m, Billy 2.0 offers a wide range of working heights, with a removable and reversible centre column, three detachable legs and optional additional foot accessories, giving you the opportunity to go from tripod to monopod to table-top tripod with ease. Available in blue or black and orange, Billy 2.0 is a compact travel-friendly tripod for everyday use. Folding down to 45.7cm it’s one of the lightest tripods in the Punks range, weighing in at just 1.57kg. Don’t let its small size fool you - it can support up to 18kg, ten times its own weight! Improving on the original Billy tripod, we’ve given our twist leg locks a face lift with improved grip and leverage, including the ability to add weight to them to lower the tripod’s centre of gravity. Perfect when combined with the detachable rubber Bootz to offer maximum stability on any terrain. Billy 2.0 comes with a whole host of accessories including the AirHed Neo 2.0 ballhead, multi-tool and handy carry bag for easy travel. Here at 3 Legged Thing we aim to innovate, inspire and be the best that we can be, so all our products feature a 5-year global warranty to give you peace of mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Nb1C8TGdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"3 Legged Thing","source_asin":"B0BN276493","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1184651","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN276493","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN276493","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
