window.products.push({"id":1184711,"name":"2023 Release WiFi Extender Signal Booster for Home, 4X Faster Longest Range Up to 9,800sq.ft and 35+ Devices, Internet Repeater with Ethernet Port,WiF","category":"electronics","retail price":58.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615aMs83kNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say Good Bye to WIFI Dead Zone with AERVY WiFi Booster and Signal Amplifier: AERVY WiFi Booster provides coverage up to 9800 square feet with advanced central processing unit and powerful new-generation chips that can extend wireless signals to hard-to-reach areas. This WiFi Extender penetrates walls and floors, extending your internet wireless network to every corner of your house for online gaming, video chat, and even streaming 4K HD video. US WiFi Security Protocol: AERVY WiFi Range Extender is designed for the USA to American Standards and uses a bank-grade financial security smart chip that promotes the latest advanced WPA/WPA2 security protocol privacy features beyond its peers. It complies with FCC and IEEE802.11b/g/n standards to protect your banking and personal data, creating the ultimate strong security and defense wall for business and personal protection. No need to be tech-savvy: AERVY WiFi Extender with Ethernet Port is easy to set up. Just press the WPS button, and the booster will be quickly matched with the existing router. It takes less than a minute to set up and connect to the WiFi so that every corner of your home has a stable and secure WiFi signal. You can also complete the setup within 3 minutes via your mobile device's web browser. Support 35 Devices：Easily connect to any brands of router and access points. Compatible with mobile phones, tablets, laptop, Smart TV, security cameras, printers and other device connections. Provides interference-free, lightning-fast data functions for your home devices. Universal Compatibility: AERVY WiFi Extender is compatible with 99% WiFi routers on the market and works with all standard routers or gateway. AERVY can also provide you with free technical support over the phone with a 2-year warranty for added peace of mind. 30-Day Free Trial: AERVY provides all customers with a 30-day free trial service and a 100% refund if they are not satisfied, giving you more peace of mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615aMs83kNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AERVY","source_asin":"B0C4J61JNK","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1184711","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4J61JNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4J61JNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
