window.products.push({"id":1184776,"name":"KVM Switch HDMI,NEWCARE 4K@60Hz KVM Switch, with 4 USB 3.0, 2 Computers Share One Monitor, Supporting Wireless Keyboard and Mouse,Plug and Play","category":"electronics","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QsNwHpEmL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【KVM SWITCH WITH 4 USB 3.0 HUB】 The NEWCARE 4K HDMI KVM switch allows you to control two computers through a single display screen and a set of controls (USB devices such as mice and keyboards). Built-in high-performance chip, high-tech decoding, plug and play, no need to drive. This will be a good choice for businesses, offices, multimedia teaching, conference rooms, game rooms, home theaters, research and testing. 【UHD 4K@60Hz VISUAL ENJOYMENT】 NEWCARE HDMI KVM Switch 2 Port support Full 18 Gpbs bandwidth, Support resolution up to 4K@60Hz, HDMI2.0b, HDCP2.2 YUV:4:4:4 chroma sampling, making display image more exquisite and realistic, really give a feast for your eyes. (The high resolution up to 4k@60Hz support, can be downward compatible with 4K@30Hz, 1080P and lower) 【Stable Transmission & Wide Compatibility】 4K 2 Port HDMI KVM Switcher compatible with PC, Laptop, Apple TV, PS3/PS4/PS5, Xbox, Sony Bluray player, projectors, audio/video receivers, and most HDMI capable devices. High-speed transmission without lag, no loss of picture, and sound quality. (The HDMI switch supports wireless keyboard and mouse and another USB device also can be recognized) 【PLUG&PLAY】 The USB KVM Switch with button switch design freely switches between 2 computers. USB switch can be powered to provide more stable signal transmission. Plug and play, saving you space. Support wireless keyboard and mouse and mechanical gaming keyboard. (Different from power by USB, power by HDMI is easier to wake up the devices when the computer is in sleep mode, which is more convenient and save time) 【Package Contents】 2 in 1 out HDMI KVM switch x1, USB Cable x2, User Manual x1, DC 5V cable x1. NEWCARE is a Manufactory that Specialized in HDMI solutions for more than 10 years. We supply lifetime Technical Support. Feel free to reach us if you have questions during use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QsNwHpEmL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEWCARE","source_asin":"B0C1F73J5M","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1184776","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1F73J5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1F73J5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
