window.products.push({"id":1184962,"name":"USB 3.0 External DVD Drive, ieGeek CD Drive Burner Slim Portable CD DVD +/-RW Writer/Rewriter/Player/Reader DVD CD ROM Drive High Speed Superdrive for","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RZ92Pp8qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Plug and play No external drive needed. This USB3.0 external optical drive can be used immediately after inserting USB. Travel easily Portable and compact, it is convenient to view DVD movies, listen to CD music, watch photos/images and copy music, video, or data to a CD. Specifications: Interface: USB 3.0 Read speed: DVD-ROM: 8X, CD-ROM: 24X, DVD-RAM 5XWrite speed: DVD ± R: 8X, DVD-RW: 6X, DVD + RW: 8X, DVD-RAM: 5X, CD-R: 24X, CD-RW: 16xCompatibility: Windows XP/2003/Vista/Win 7/Win 8/Win 10/Linux/Mac OS(Note: it is not compatible with Mac OS 10.8.0 and above or PC with type C terminal.) Pack list: 1xDVD drive1Xusb3.0 data cable Note: 1. When using, please put the drive on a stable desktop, do not erect/squeeze.2. Please download and install the burning software before burning DVD, CD discs. Q&A 1: Why is the device unrecognizable to PC?For desktop, please connect the DVD drive to the USB port of the motherboard for normal use. For notebook, please insert to the direct USB port, try not to use USB hub nor extension cords, it may not recognize the Driver or read the CD/DVD.2. Does it work with imac/macOS Sierra?Technically it will. If not, please test it with other computer to see if something different? If the item is defective, we could replace or refund on it.3. Does it work with surface?No, it's not compatible with surface, the surface cannot export enough power for its function.4. Will it work with Windows 10?Yes, it is compatible with Win 10. If it fails to play DVD on win 10, please download a third party video player to make them work together.5. Why the DVD could not eject on Apple system?Due to system restrictions, you need to click the CD icon on the Apple computer desktop and select exit the CD. The exiting could not be completed through directly pressing the button on the burner.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RZ92Pp8qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ieGeek","source_asin":"B01N2IPY0E","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1184962","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N2IPY0E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N2IPY0E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
